{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the adventure club!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based dungeon crawler, you get to know four girls that make up the continent's best adventure club, as you all enter the imaginary fantasy land of Anastasia to play various games: you can play tag, hide &amp; seek and more, and also play that you're heroes traversing treacherous dungeons that houses many dangerous enemies, all before going home to a relaxing sleepover and a fairy-tale marathon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt and humorous story featuring quirky characters you can build friendship bonds with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playful and colorful fantasy land with various games to play, such as tag, hide &amp; seek, treasure hunting and racing.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast, intricate dungeons filled with enemies to fight and puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based battle system with a focus on special attacks and color-coded enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-narrative aspects and multiple endings.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389960?t=1771678853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389960/e5230a9572575cf86bfee1c949d507497dab902e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771678853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389960/f0dfecb628f5ab57d3caa19c55b9933cc9a2ff3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771678853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389960/f0dfecb628f5ab57d3caa19c55b9933cc9a2ff3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771678853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full contr